    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382450/extras/89c449fd5b7416f4f9e0e2a34381c0d5.poster.avif?t=1753067026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382450/extras/89c449fd5b7416f4f9e0e2a34381c0d5.webm?t=1753067026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382450/extras/89c449fd5b7416f4f9e0e2a34381c0d5.mp4?t=1753067026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Start with a brand new ship with limited weapons and upgrades.<br></li><li>Shoot down Asteroids and Enemy ships for resources (Iron, Gold, Platinum).<br></li><li>Use these resources to purchase new upgrades like ship enhancements and new weapons.<br></li><li>Your progress will persist and each play session will have you becoming stronger and being able to last longer in the game.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382450/extras/6b6035547f7410df23794047b2a64224.poster.avif?t=1753067026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382450/extras/6b6035547f7410df23794047b2a64224.webm?t=1753067026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382450/extras/6b6035547f7410df23794047b2a64224.mp4?t=1753067026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Classic</strong> - A retro style game mode featuring more classic style endless gameplay.<br></li><li><strong>Arcade</strong> - A more arcadey experience where randomized upgrades will appear as physical objects for you to acquire and equip. Each game session will be different from the last leading to endless replayability.<br></li><li><strong>Chaos Agent</strong> - Take on a horde of endless enemies in this boss rush style gameplay. How long can you last before being overrun?<br></li><li><strong>Cadet</strong> - A spin on the classic gameplay with a more open level approach that has you not only battling against tougher enemies but navigating around dangerous black holes, supernovas, planets and wormholes but also mazes for you to navigate.<br></li><li><strong>Galactic Hero</strong> - A tougher version of Cadet that will hit harder but will reward higher resources for your success.<br></li><li><strong>Survive</strong> - A special game mode where you have limited rockets &amp; no rocket regeneration. Each new level you survive, you will be awarded the choice of a new upgrade to continue.<br></li><li><strong>Void</strong> - Find the special portal to advance to the next level. As you search, take on various hazards of each level.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382450/extras/3ee378716e726c1c2e3e17b79953fa23.poster.avif?t=1753067026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382450/extras/3ee378716e726c1c2e3e17b79953fa23.webm?t=1753067026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382450/extras/3ee378716e726c1c2e3e17b79953fa23.mp4?t=1753067026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Seven Different Arcade / Roguelite Game Modes<br></li><li>The Wild Open - An exploration sandbox experience to play and mess around in<br></li><li>Ship Upgrades - Upgrade your play style with new weapons and enhancements over time<br></li><li>Local Co-Op / Versus Modes<br></li><li>Online Co-Op / Versus Modes<br></li><li>Alternate Visual Mode to Unlock<br></li><li>Achievements<br></li><li>Leaderboards</li></ul>",
