on will be different from the last leading to endless replayability.<br></li><li><strong>Chaos Agent</strong> - Take on a horde of endless enemies in this boss rush style gameplay. How long can you last before being overrun?<br></li><li><strong>Cadet</strong> - A spin on the classic gameplay with a more open level approach that has you not only battling against tougher enemies but navigating around dangerous black holes, supernovas, planets and wormholes but also mazes for you to navigate.<br></li><li><strong>Galactic Hero</strong> - A tougher version of Cadet that will hit harder but will reward higher resources for your success.<br></li><li><strong>Survive</strong> - A special game mode where you have limited rockets &amp; no rocket regeneration. Each new level you survive, you will be awarded the choice of a new upgrade to continue.<br></li><li><strong>Void</strong> - Find the special portal to advance to the next level. As you search, take on various hazards of each level.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382450/extras/3ee378716e726c1c2e3e17b79953fa23.poster.avif?t=1753067026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382450/extras/3ee378716e726c1c2e3e17b79953fa23.webm?t=1753067026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382450/extras/3ee378716e726c1c2e3e17b79953fa23.mp4?t=1753067026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Seven Different Arcade / Roguelite Game Modes<br></li><li>The Wild Open - An exploration sandbox experience to play and mess around in<br></li><li>Ship Upgrades - Upgrade your play style with new weapons and enhancements over time<br></li><li>Local Co-Op / Versus Modes<br></li><li>Online Co-Op / Versus Modes<br></li><li>Alternate Visual Mode to Unlock<br></li><li>Achievements<br></li><li>Leaderboards</li></ul>",
